# Read AGENTS.md

This repository has one authoritative project-rules document: `AGENTS.md` at the repo root.

- Read `AGENTS.md` in full and follow it.
- `.cursor/rules/` is only an entry point; it must not duplicate or override `AGENTS.md`. If they appear to conflict, `AGENTS.md` wins.
- When changing project constraints, edit only `AGENTS.md`; do not add topical rules here.
